                                                "sense_id": "c8bbf858-c154-3a1f-8f00-461d4b8c6123",
                                                "text": "Now if you can shew so neat a foot, ( shewing her shoe ) —Parlez moi de ça : —I suppose I was not noble enough for this squire; he must have a bit a blood, a tit of quality — but I shall be a countess soon, and a mighty good sort of countess I shall make."
